# std/llm-call's image (design/caos-expr.md, Phase 3): build this directory as a
# Rust project with rustc. `--src:@=.` hands rustc the tool (Cargo.toml + src/;
# rustc skips the caos metadata — .caos-expr, DEPS, DEEP-DEPS/); `--dep0:@=…`
# hands it the llm-client code crate, spliced at `llm-client/`; `--runner:@=…` is
# the base its `finish` curries the built binary onto. All deps are named by
# LOCAL deep-deps mounts (declared in DEPS), never ambient /std.
run DEEP-DEPS/rustc -- --src:@=. --dep0:@=DEEP-DEPS/llm-client --runner:@=DEEP-DEPS/runner
